   "q": "Orchard Ltd is a private company with one class of ordinary shares and unamended Model Articles. It was incorporated in 2018. The directors want to allot 1,000 new ordinary shares to an outside investor, Maya, for cash. The existing shareholders do not want to be offered the shares.\n\nWhat is the best advice on the shareholder approval needed?",
