      "ask": "Is it a multi-track claim under £10 million?",
      "body": "- Directions: disclosure, witnesses, experts, pre-trial checklist, trial; consider **ADR**\n- **Precedent H** budget: with DQ if < **£50,000**, else **21 days** before first CMC\n- **Precedent R** **7 days** before CMC; **CMO**; no departure without **good reason**\n- No budget → **court fees only** (CPR 3.14)",
      "yes": "costs management applies",
