      "body": "- Sanctions: costs, payment into court, **debarring** evidence, **unless orders**, **strike out** (CPR 3.4)\n- Automatic: late witness statement (CPR 32.10), undisclosed expert report (35.13), late budget (3.14)\n- Agreed extension up to **28 days** if no hearing date at risk (CPR 3.8(4))\n- Applied **before** deadline → overriding objective only",
