      "body": "- Consent needed if third party **communicated assent** to promisor (on **receipt**, no postal rule), promisor **knew of reliance**, or reliance was **foreseeable and occurred** (**s.2(1)-(2)**)\n- Contract may expressly allow free variation (**s.2(3)**); court may dispense with consent (**s.2(4)-(5)**)",
      "yes": "variation not binding on the third party without consent",
      "no": "variation effective"
