      "ask": "If the Act does not help, is there another way round privity?",
      "body": "- **Promisee sues**: specific performance (**Beswick**); damages for third party's loss in limited cases (**Jackson v Horizon**, **Linden Gardens**, not if own direct right: **Panatown**)\n- **Collateral contract** (**Shanklin Pier**); **trust** of a promise (rare: **Les Affréteurs**)\n- **Assignment**: LPA 1925 s.136 (absolute, signed writing, written notice to debtor); burden needs **novation**\n- **Tort** (negligence)",
      "yes": "apply that route",
