   "q": "Ashgrove Ltd posted an online notice offering £5,000 to anyone who recovers its stolen prototype drone and returns it to its office. Priya tracked the drone to a storage unit and spent three days arranging access and transport. As she was driving it to Ashgrove's office, Ashgrove posted a further notice withdrawing the reward. Priya delivered the drone an hour later.\n\nWhich of the following best describes Priya's position?",
