      "body": "- Ordinary employer's duty; no Alcock controls\n- Was harm to **this** employee **reasonably foreseeable**? (signs, known vulnerability: **Hatton**, **Barber**)\n- Second breakdown after warning foreseeable (**Walker**); counselling service often enough",
      "yes": "apply the Hatton guidance, then breach and causation",
