      "h": "Distinguish?",
      "ask": "Are the material facts of the present case different?",
      "body": "- **Any** court can distinguish (**Balfour** v **Merritt**: separation made the difference)\n- **Overruling** = higher court says rule in a different case wrong (retrospective effect); **reversing** = same case on appeal",
