      "body": "- **Pre-2021**: assimilated EU case law; binds **High Court and below**; **Court of Appeal/Supreme Court** may depart\n- **Post-2020**: **not binding**; courts **may have regard** (s.6(2) EUWA)\n- **No references** to the CJEU (save Withdrawal Agreement routes)",
