      "body": "- Undue influence = **coercion** overbearing the testator; persuasion is fine\n- **Never presumed** for wills; **challenger proves**; must be the **only reasonable explanation** (**Edwards v Edwards**)\n- **Fraudulent calumny**: lies poisoning testator against a relative\n- Conduct: instructions **from the client alone** (Code para 3.1); solicitor gift = **own-interest conflict** (para 6.1)",
      "yes": "will or affected part invalid: go to step 6",
