      "body": "- Discretionary → **outside estate**; **expression of wishes** not binding\n- IHT: outside for deaths **before 6 April 2027**; from then most unused funds/death benefits **included** (FA 2026); **death-in-service** and **dependants' scheme pensions** excluded; spouse exempt; **PRs** report and pay",
