      "ask": "Has the estate's money been held long enough, or in large enough sums, for a fair sum of interest to be due?",
      "body": "- **r.7.1** fair sum, unless written agreement with **informed consent** (r.7.2)\n- Consider a **separate designated client account** for large long-held sums",
