      "body": "- Paying the price or mortgage, major building work (**Eves**), paying bills to free the owner to pay the mortgage (**Grant v Edwards**)\n- Chores or minor bills alone are weak\n- Quantify by the **whole course of dealing**; may impute a fair share (**Oxley v Hiscock**: 40%; **Kernott**)",
      "yes": "constructive trust: the claimant has the share quantified",
