   "q": "In 2020 Sam settled £500,000 on trust for his daughter Tia 'if she attains the age of 30'. If Tia dies under 30, the fund passes to Tia's brother Uri absolutely. Tia is now 24 and Uri is 27. Both are of sound mind. Tia and Uri want the trustees to transfer the fund to them now, in equal shares.\n\nWhat is the best advice?",
