      "body": "- Legal: **charge by deed** (LPA ss.85-87), **registered** (LRA ss.23, 27); first legal mortgage of unregistered land triggers first registration\n- Equitable: mortgage of equitable interest, unregistered legal charge, written equitable charge (**s.53(1)(a)**)",
