      "body": "- Lender's option to buy in the mortgage: void (**Samuel v Jarrah**); separate later deal OK (**Reeve v Lisle**)\n- Postponement void if illusory (**Fairclough**: 17-year lease) but OK between commercial equals (**Knightsbridge**: 40 years)\n- Collateral advantages OK unless unconscionable (**Kreglinger**)\n- Unconscionable premium/interest struck down (**Cityland v Dabrah**)",
