   "q": "Nadia and Owen are beneficial co-owners of a house that they bought as a home for themselves and their children, now aged 8 and 10. Nadia has been made bankrupt. Eighteen months later, her trustee in bankruptcy applies for an order for sale. Owen wants to keep the children in the house.\n\nWhich of the following best describes how the court is likely to approach the application?",
