      "body": "- **FRI** lease of whole: tenant bears all; multi-let: tenant interior, landlord structure via **service charge**\n- Repair = renewal of parts, not a different thing (**Ravenseft**: question of degree); 'keep in repair' includes **putting** into repair\n- Tenant: **schedule of condition**; exclude **inherent defects** and **insured risks**\n- Landlord insures; tenant wants **reinstatement**, **rent suspension**, right to **terminate**, uninsured risks provision",
