      "body": "- Open market (often **upwards only**), index-linked (cap/collar), fixed, turnover\n- **Assumptions**: willing parties, vacant possession, fit for use, tenant complied with covenants\n- **Disregards**: tenant's occupation, **goodwill**, **improvements**\n- Review time limits **not of the essence** (**United Scientific**) unless express or linked to a break\n- **Arbitrator** (judicial) v **expert** (own knowledge, negligence liability)",
