      "body": "- Householder extensions, Class E → C3 (**prior approval**), temporary uses, minor works\n- Removed by **Article 4 direction** or condition; restricted in **conservation areas**/listed buildings\n- Else: apply; full permission start within **3 years**; outline: reserved matters within **3 years**; start by the later of **3 years** from outline or **2 years** from final reserved-matters approval; conditions and **s.106** bind successors; **LDC** s.191/192",
      "yes": "no application needed",
