      "body": "- **England**, breaches from **25 April 2024**: **10 years** for all\n- England transitional: operational development substantially completed / change to single dwelling **before 25 April 2024** → **4 years**\n- **Wales**: 4 years (operational, single dwelling); 10 years others\n- Concealment defeats immunity (**Welwyn Hatfield**; planning enforcement order)\n- Powers: **PCN**, enforcement warning notice, **enforcement notice** (appeal suspends), **stop notice**, **temporary stop notice** (56 days), **breach of condition notice** (no appeal), injunction",
