   "q": "Tamsin's company is buying an office building from Ulric Ltd for £2 million. The contract incorporates the Standard Commercial Property Conditions (3rd edition), and Ulric Ltd has opted to tax the building. Nothing in the special conditions deals with VAT. The sale is not a transfer of a going concern.\n\nWhich of the following best describes the VAT position?",
