      "body": "- The word **\"undertake\" is not needed**\n- \"I will try\" or a statement of expectation is not a promise\n- Typical: **redeem mortgage**, pay costs, hold documents **to order**",
      "yes": "Go to step 3",
      "no": "No undertaking; consider para 1.4 if it was misleading"
