      "body": "- Personal to the solicitor and binds the **firm**, including when given by a **trainee** with authority\n- \"On behalf of client\" still binds unless personal liability **clearly excluded**\n- Conditional undertaking binds only once the **condition** is met",
      "yes": "Go to step 4",
