   "ask": "Has the firm reconciled the bank balance, cash book and client ledger total at least every five weeks?",
   "body": "- **r.8.3**: all client accounts, at least **every 5 weeks** (monthly complies; six weeks does not)\n- Adjust the bank figure: **deduct unpresented** payments, **add outstanding lodgements**\n- Adjusted bank = cash book = total of client ledger balances",
