   "body": "- **COFA or a manager** (partner, member of a limited liability partnership, director), not just the cashier or office manager\n- Ledger total above the bank figure = shortfall: **replace immediately** (r.6.1)\n- An overdrawn client ledger is a breach even if the totals agree",
