   "ask": "Is there a central record of bills, and are records stored securely for at least six years?",
   "body": "- **r.8.4**: readily accessible central record of all bills and written notifications of costs\n- **r.13.1**: store all accounting records securely, keep **at least 6 years**",
   "yes": "Compliant",
   "no": "Breach of r.8.4 or r.13.1"
