   "ask": "Is the money held for the personal representatives, or by a partner or employee as executor or trustee?",
   "body": "- The **personal representatives** (PRs: executors or administrators) are the client, not the beneficiaries\n- Estate money = client money (**r.2.1(a)**), on the estate ledger\n- Partner as executor or trustee = client money (**r.2.1(c)**), unless the office's rules conflict (r.2.3(a))\n- Money left in an estate account in the PRs' names that the solicitor signs on = **r.10** (statements, reconciliation, bills record)",
