   "ask": "Is inheritance tax being paid from money held in client account for this estate?",
   "body": "- Due **6 months after the end of the month of death** (Inheritance Tax Act 1984 s.226), usually before the **grant of representation**\n- **Direct payment scheme**: the deceased's bank pays HM Revenue & Customs directly: no entries in the firm's books\n- From client account: **DR estate ledger client; CR client cash**, only if **this estate** has enough (r.5.3)\n- Bank loan to the PRs paid to the firm is client money\n!! Never use another estate's money, even for a day",
