   "ask": "Is the invoice addressed to the client, and has a bill been delivered before costs are taken?",
   "body": "- **Probate application fee**: agency, no VAT\n- **Trustee Act 1925 s.27** notices for creditors, valuers, estate agents: agency if addressed to the PRs, **principal** (business account only) if addressed to the firm\n- Costs: **bill or written notification to the PRs first** (r.4.3), specific sum, covered by the estate balance",
   "yes": "Pay or transfer as allowed",
