   "body": "- On death the property passes to the **surviving trustees** (Trustee Act 1925 s.18); no duty to replace if enough remain\n- These are the **s.36(1)** grounds for appointing a replacement; express removal power: s.36(2)\n- **Additional** trustees can be appointed where there are **not more than three**, taking the total to no more than four (s.36(6))",
