   "body": "- Order: the **nominated person**, then the **continuing trustees** (including a retiring or refusing trustee: s.36(8)), then the **personal representatives of the last surviving trustee**\n- Must be **in writing**; use a **deed**, so that s.40 vests the property automatically\n- Not shares (need a registered transfer); registered land also needs **registration** of the new trustees",
   "yes": "the nominated person appoints",
   "no": "the continuing trustees, or failing them the last trustee's personal representatives, appoint"
