   "body": "- Beneficiaries always have the necessary **equitable proprietary interest**\n- Lost if **dissipated** (spent on living costs, or used to pay off a **debt or overdraft**) or if it reached a **bona fide purchaser for value without notice**\n- Not where unfair to an innocent volunteer: **Re Diplock** (charities had spent wrongly paid money improving their own buildings: no tracing into the buildings)\n- Tracing into an asset bought **before** the money arrived only with a co-ordinated scheme",
