   "body": "- **Agreement for lease** if the landlord must do **works** first, a **condition** must be met (planning, superior landlord's or lender's consent), or the parties want to be bound now\n- Contracting out of the Landlord and Tenant Act 1954: warning notice and declaration **before** the tenant signs the agreement for lease\n- Lease **over 7 years**: ask for the landlord's **freehold title** (needed for absolute leasehold title and by the lender); check the landlord's **lender consents** to the letting; underlease: check the **head lease**\n- Enquiries: Commercial Property Standard Enquiries (general form plus new-lease form); searches; **survey** if the tenant repairs",
